Child windows over the window's DirectComposition visual (Task 6 of docs/plans/20261029-windows-support.md): GPUI
composes its swap chain into a DirectComposition target made topmost over the window, which draws over every child
window, so a native child (the HTML overlays' `WebView2` pages, ngterm-gpui's `html_overlay/webview2`) would never
show. The target is made beneath the child windows instead; GPUI has none of its own, so nothing else it draws moves.
scripts/vendor-gpui.sh applies this to the verified crates.io archive.

